<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ADCORP YEAR SHR RISES 46 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>ADCORP YEAR SHR RISES 46 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31 </p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Headline shr, (cts)   41.0	  vs 28.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 8.0	   vs 6.0  </p>
<p>    Attrib income	   7.88	  vs 2.60</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   13.20	 vs 2.50</p>
<p>    Tax			 3.84	  vs 0.89</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   4.07	  vs 3.68</p>
<p>    Turnover		  212.34	vs 78.85</p>
<p>Full name: Adcorp Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The firm did not give any dividend date details.</p>
<p>Adcorp said group companies are currently trading ahead of 1996</p>
<p>levels and -- given a stable environment -- it anticipated an</p>
<p>increase in earnings per share in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
